<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n47694" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Tĕmĕsa</span></b> , ae; <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Tĕmĕsē</span></b> , ēs; and <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Tempsa</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Temsa</span></b> ), ae,
		f., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Τεμέση</span> or <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Τέμψα,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a town in the
				territory of the Bruttians</i>, <i>where there
				were copper mines</i>, now <i>Torre del Piano del
				Casale</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Temesa,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Mel.
					2, 4, 9</span></i>
			. Temese, Ov M. 15, 52; 15, 707; <i><span class="en">Stat. S. 1,
				1, 42</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Tempsa (Temsa),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					3, 5, 10, § 72</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Liv. 34, 45, 4</span></i>. — Hence,
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Tĕmĕsae-us</span></b> , a, um,
				adj., <i>of</i> or <i>belonging to Temesa</i>, <i>Temesan</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aera,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. M.
					7, 207</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">id. F 5, 441</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Stat. S. 1,
				5, 47</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Tempsānus</span></b> , a,
				um, adj., <i>of Temesa</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ager,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					34, 45</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">incommodum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic. Verr. 2, 5, 15, § 39</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
